    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Slaqsa'aá mungui mi tleehhara', slaqsoó taa hhaásl mu sihhtisaara', laqaá uheemi, laqaá slaqsoó tlaa/aá taa hhaásl baraá yaamuhunge, nee mu i tumbarara'amitara'. Aníng an AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deelór Sabaátor'eé' amohhe'eemisaak, nee didá' ak ló'wa hhoohhoó' ilaiwawa/aak. Aníng an AAKOÓ MUNGÚ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Barnaxes daber'eé' aga eehadé' nee kaahir'eé' kay oté', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aníng nun tluwáy haniís ar qoomoó hariím, yaamu nay bu'úngw yaariír i laqwaaliyá', xaa'aá baraá qamuuhúng na/ii ngiri laqwaaliyá' sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaangw slahhaango an kumaamitá' ay qoomár bu'úngw sabiíbu, nee bu'úngw sabiíbu ay qoomár tawa dahaasin. Muruú /aymár bu'uút un sleerá', nee an hotá' ar amohhooa baraá yaamuuhunge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Nun waydií haniís baraá yaamuwo, tam tari guá', tundu dae tlaaqiiká. Makaá xaraaslá' in hingeés baraá yaamuwo, nee yaamuuhúng slaqwara gi baloó haradatká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakuuserhúng an gusá' nee an paangadúr tsu/á'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhúng oo kooán wakuusér tsiiru ngin guusiyá', nee mukhúng oo tsiiru wakuusér kumuú wák ngin guusiyá', wakuuserhúng an geerahúng wa qwaaresá' ar paánga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng kuungá' nu i qaytsiít nuri na/aá yaariír i haniís nee tari doogiindá', aníng alqador'eé' ngiri gawdeés dirhunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár bu'uungo kuungá' a qarnaa an /agá'. Nee slám qarna an bihhií qasá' as pa/aangw kuwa sleera' oo bu'úngw /abén kway qasa'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng dír hotaaeé' an tleéhh baraá tla/angwhúng nee kuungá' nu baloó geexawaaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An hi'iimiít baraá tla/angwhúng wa ale, aníng tari Munguúhúng nee kuungá' tari muk'eé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng an AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng, kudá' kuungá' naa baraá Misrír wa duux as tawa lawaalér múk Misrirooká. Aníng taaqwani aga geeqáw tidá' taa tseék gawaá isoohúng, as kahhó' tawa hota' ar amohhooa.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala bar aníng iga iiárií qasi'iiká, laqaá hara'ayar'eé' aga eehadi'iiká, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laqaá kaahir'eé' bara waaqaé' nee hara'ayar'eé' kay ahhé' nee daber'eé' kay meeré' sleémeero, nee alqador'eé' kay sié', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "daqaní aníng adoorí an tleéhh, nun slaáhh ar nuwa de'ér urií huuw ar gaanslaay, nee tiqtír da/eewe, nee ga/atantá nu ila' taampuupuuw, nuri naduduúr. Dahaasingwhúng un dahaasiindá' ala u gár wa sleera'aaká, asma wakuuserhúng gun /ák. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng nun harasihhiít, nee wakuuserhúng nuri múx, tunduri sawaawuti'ín nee kudá' naa aahhiye', tundun dae tlaaq, nee tari ti'i'iindá' tam handá' heé naa guus i kahhi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Nee tam alaá tunduwa doohhiís iga iiárií qasi'iiká, naagáy, nun doohhiís ki/ima faanqw as tlakweemaahúng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng daara/angwhúng un faák ar tluwaay nguwa ilaa/, asma doori in gawdeés adór muqsli, nee yaamuuhúng in gawdeés adór muqslír sirdaa/aat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Uureemoohúng in tawo hhitiindá', asma qamuuhúng balaangw ngu hamareesiaaká, nee yaamuuhúng i mamaá laqwaliaaká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Bar aga kumité' aníng tlampa'amisuuwo nee iwa siasia' axamisuuwo, aníng muxtarhúng ngi male doók ki/ima faanqw ar qoomoó yaareemaá tlakweemaahúng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nun makaá xaraaslá' i tleés awa na/iihúng ngi xampoamiisá', nee hikwaahúng ngiri /ayiyá' nee faarorhúng iri /aaruúr, nee lohduuhúng niri warqayá' tari adór xaanxaay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Barnaxes alaá muxtasinge aníng iga i warqeeri'iiká', ala ana kumité' tlampa'amisueene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naagáy aníng nee kuungá' tin tlampa'asaán nee nuri muúx ki/ima faanqw as tlakweemaahúng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nun paángárí huúw as li/oó alqador'eé' tidá' taa geeqeeré' nguwa buu'. Kuungá' bara gobé' baraá gixsaduhúng, ala nuri tiqtír tlákw i kwaáhh, nee nuri baraá dabaá wakuuserhúng i qaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muruú /aymarhúng un /aareés, tam /ameenár mibaangw tla/afír wák gan wa huuriín, nun i qasmiisiyá' ar qoomaay. Tam alaá /aymaro kuungá' aqo qwaritá'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
