        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Nee tam alaá tí sleémeero iga iiárií qasi'iikahe, ala an kumitá' iwa tlampa'amisa', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naagáy aníng kuungá' nu tlampa'aás ar xarasleemaeé', nee nuri muúx anuú kilá' ki/ima faanqw, asma tlakweemaahúng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na/iihúng awa daaqaay nee awa dasuuwo kiri /agá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dirhúng tidár firo ar gawaá gongoamo an hhitiím, kiteerihúng kudaá ilahhooa in feé/, nee kudá' mooyángw tsuú' tleemis, nee tu'uuhúng ngiri kwaáhh gawaá daanduú tuaá murslaaqatuhúng, qeeruueé' kuungá' nuri ló'wa aahh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gixsaduhúng in daá/, dirhúng tidá' hhoohhoo' an xaanxay tleéhh nee ilahhooár mooyangwhúng kudá' tsuú' u baloó ya/amaaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaamuuhúng in hhitiím tam wakuuserhúng ar baraadií loohoó slaa' kiwa waa/oo/i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nun tsiyayaáx baraá tla/ángw xoordu, nee nuri paangadúr ayá', yaamuuhúng niri darma tleehhiyá' nee gixsaduhúng niri hhituruutiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár kuungá' bar baraá dabaá wakuuserhúng i diriá', an qoomár yaamu Sabaáto ngiwa saqwala/iya', qoomár niwa darma tleehhitiyé', yaamu niri hungu/usiyá' nee niri qwalaala/iyá' as Sabaátor'ín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qooma sleémeero ar yaamu niwa darmuú wa iwiwiitiya', Sabaátor'ín ngin slayá', tidá' naa slayi'iiká' kuungá' tawa baraadá' wa hooté'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Nee mukhúng bahh'ale oo aa meet un daeérí tleés gur'er'íne ma'aay ngay dalaa/iyá', baraá yaamaá wakuuser'ine, tam afór loo/ír fur'a ir tlatleer bar kaa axaás, gin tlatlahhás. Gin tlatlahhás adór múk aa slaqwarár wa goow. Nin gogowiyá' nay huhu'uná', tam heé gi gusisiím i kahhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tin i huhu'uná' tawo alé adór heé naa goow slaqwarár wa ale, tam heé gi gusisiím i kahhi. /Uuruú niiná ta koondá' i kaahh oo wakuusérhúng kawa bala'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An baraá tla/ángw xoordú i qwadá', nee yaamaá wakuuserhúng nun gu/iyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaxes bartaka aa mét baraá yaamaá wakuuserhúng, nin naduumitiyá' nee niri faakiyá' as tlakweemaaín nee as tlakweemaá baabi'ii'ín.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala barnaxes tlakweemaaín ngaa hhu'uu'uné', nee tlakweemaá baabi'ii'ine, gawaá aahhidá' tinda aníng i tleehhi, nee inooín aníng iwa tlampa'aamisiye', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gár aníng nee inooín tisa tlaampa'aamisaán bar ngaa tsaahhiyé', nee gár ngisa huúw baraá yaamaá wakuuser'ín, nee barnaxes ar ló' muner'ín tidá' gawden aa wanana'át nee tlakweemaaín ngiri hhu'uu'uné', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aníng daqaní alqador'eé' an insláw, tidá' naa tleéhh nee Abrahamu, nee Isaka, nee Yakobo, nee yaamuudá' ngi al'axweés ngiri insláw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár inooín yaamuuín birnga geexayé', yaamu Sabaátor'ín ngin saqwalaa/iyá', qoomár bar yaamuuín naa darma tleehhitiyé', qoomaadae bar inooín tlakweemaaín ngaa hhu'uu'uné', kudá' hara'ayar'eé' ngiwa waaqaiyé', nee ngiwa aahhiyé', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ala baraá tisíng sleémeerowo qoomár inooín tawa baraá yaamaá wakuuser'ín i dirii'i, aníng i kwahhaaká, laqaá i aahhaaká, tam ngiri ló'wa hhaamiís, nee alqador'eé' ngiri kwaáhh. Asma aníng an AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aasla'áy, as inooine alqador'eé' an insláw, tidá' naa tleéhh nee baabi'ii'ín, kudá' naa baraá yaamaá Misrír wa duúx, as án niwa Munguúín tleehhiit, adoorí xoordu ngina ariyé'. Aníng an AAKOÓ MUNGÚ.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
